# Dress Down is on the battlefield before H.M.S. Bounty enters, and Yargle stations Bounty to nine charge counters. Its 8+
# striation is one static ability whose effect began in layer 4 (CR 721.2a-b), so its layer 6 part keeps applying although Dress
# Down, earlier in layer 6, took Bounty's abilities (CR 613.6) - and that part gives Bounty, after Dress Down, flying and "Whenever
# H.M.S. Bounty deals combat damage to a player, draw a card. ..." (CR 613.1f). Lightning Greaves, attached after Dress Down,
# gives it haste: it hits for 3 and its controller draws a card.

